    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Non-Stop Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into fast-paced, exhilarating combat where every hit feels satisfying and every victory, rewarding. Master your aim and unleash powerful abilities with precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092340/extras/91517df457b212b7a0378e18db8d1378.poster.avif?t=1736369873\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092340/extras/91517df457b212b7a0378e18db8d1378.webm?t=1736369873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092340/extras/91517df457b212b7a0378e18db8d1378.mp4?t=1736369873\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Progress Your Way</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rack up currency and unleash your potential! Level up your character's stats and forge your destiny by buying, crafting, and equipping permanent items. Power up, fine-tune your build, and dominate your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092340/extras/1b621d7a85c4a61a1c7e5045ce1e0dcc.poster.avif?t=1736369873\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092340/extras/1b621d7a85c4a61a1c7e5045ce1e0dcc.webm?t=1736369873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092340/extras/1b621d7a85c4a61a1c7e5045ce1e0dcc.mp4?t=1736369873\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Hundreds of Combinations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover an arsenal of weapons, abilities, modifiers, and items. Mix and match to craft your perfect build and unlock devastating combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092340/extras/9fb1530e4840be89b0c62f466c7c75bb.poster.avif?t=1736369873\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092340/extras/9fb1530e4840be89b0c62f466c7c75bb.webm?t=1736369873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092340/extras/9fb1530e4840be89b0c62f466c7c75bb.mp4?t=1736369873\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Endless Replayability</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No two runs are ever the same! With dynamic gameplay, each adventure feels fresh and unpredictable. Level up, pick your rewards, and shape your character\u2019s destiny. Defeat enemies, collect gold, and invest in powerful upgrades from merchants to grow even stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092340/extras/627efdaaed9c753a3b2eba02109f255b.poster.avif?t=1736369873\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092340/extras/627efdaaed9c753a3b2eba02109f255b.webm?t=1736369873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092340/extras/627efdaaed9c753a3b2eba02109f255b.mp4?t=1736369873\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Formidable Enemies and Bosses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face off against enemies that have their own unique abilities and synergies. Survive relentless waves, as exceeding the enemy limit spells defeat. Challenge yourself against epic bosses with multi-phase battles and unpredictable abilities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Diverse Environments and Mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a variety of levels, each with their own distinct mechanics. There\u2019s always something new to experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>And much more awaits!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prepare for an action-packed journey full of surprises, challenges, and endless possibilities.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Non-Stop Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into fast-paced, exhilarating combat where every hit feels satisfying and every victory, rewarding. Master your aim and unleash powerful abilities with precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092340/extras/91517df457b212b7a0378e18db8d1378.poster.avif?t=1736369873\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092340/extras/91517df457b212b7a0378e18db8d1378.webm?t=1736369873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092340/extras/91517df457b212b7a0378e18db8d1378.mp4?t=1736369873\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Progress Your Way</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rack up currency and unleash your potential! Level up your character's stats and forge your destiny by buying, crafting, and equipping permanent items. Power up, fine-tune your build, and dominate your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092340/extras/1b621d7a85c4a61a1c7e5045ce1e0dcc.poster.avif?t=1736369873\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092340/extras/1b621d7a85c4a61a1c7e5045ce1e0dcc.webm?t=1736369873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092340/extras/1b621d7a85c4a61a1c7e5045ce1e0dcc.mp4?t=1736369873\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Hundreds of Combinations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover an arsenal of weapons, abilities, modifiers, and items. Mix and match to craft your perfect build and unlock devastating combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092340/extras/9fb1530e4840be89b0c62f466c7c75bb.poster.avif?t=1736369873\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092340/extras/9fb1530e4840be89b0c62f466c7c75bb.webm?t=1736369873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092340/extras/9fb1530e4840be89b0c62f466c7c75bb.mp4?t=1736369873\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Endless Replayability</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No two runs are ever the same! With dynamic gameplay, each adventure feels fresh and unpredictable. Level up, pick your rewards, and shape your character\u2019s destiny. Defeat enemies, collect gold, and invest in powerful upgrades from merchants to grow even stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092340/extras/627efdaaed9c753a3b2eba02109f255b.poster.avif?t=1736369873\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092340/extras/627efdaaed9c753a3b2eba02109f255b.webm?t=1736369873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092340/extras/627efdaaed9c753a3b2eba02109f255b.mp4?t=1736369873\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Formidable Enemies and Bosses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face off against enemies that have their own unique abilities and synergies. Survive relentless waves, as exceeding the enemy limit spells defeat. Challenge yourself against epic bosses with multi-phase battles and unpredictable abilities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Diverse Environments and Mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a variety of levels, each with their own distinct mechanics. There\u2019s always something new to experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>And much more awaits!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prepare for an action-packed journey full of surprises, challenges, and endless possibilities.</p>",
    "short_description": "Spellshaper is a fast-paced action roguelike blending hack-and-slash combat with deep ability customization. Choose from a vast arsenal of weapons, items, abilities and modifiers to create unique and increasingly powerful combinations. Battle against relentless waves of enemies.",
